// "[Player] sacrifices [permanent]" [CR#701.21a]: its controller, the actor,
// moves it from
// the battlefield directly to its owner's graveyard. Sacrificing is not
// destroying, so nothing that replaces destruction sees it. Lean `sacrifice`.
KeywordAction(
    name: "sacrifice",
    params: [Subject],
    spelling: "sacrifice",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "sacrifice",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
    body: move(Param(0), battlefield, graveyard),
)
